---
import { industries, needs } from '../data/discovery';
interface Props { slug: string; }
const { slug } = Astro.props;
const sectors = industries.filter(item => item.roles.includes(slug)).slice(0, 2);
const problems = needs.filter(item => item.roles.includes(slug)).slice(0, 2);
---
<section class="section related-section"><div class="wrap related-grid"><div><h2>Where this role could fit.</h2>{sectors.length === 0 && <p>Define the responsibilities around your business, then <a href="/industries/">explore potential industry applications</a>.</p>}<ul class="related-links">{sectors.map(item => <li><a href={`/industries/${item.slug}/`}>{item.name} </a></li>)}</ul></div><div><h2>Start with your business need.</h2>{problems.length === 0 && <p>Explore <a href="/business-needs/add-capacity/">adding dedicated capacity</a> around the recurring work in your team.</p>}<ul class="related-links">{problems.map(item => <li><a href={`/business-needs/${item.slug}/`}>{item.name} </a></li>)}</ul></div></div></section>
